  "evidence": [
    "Pinned parse_string625880..625DDD walks six inline text rows from6972D4 to69734C at stride14(hex), calling strstr6468D0 on each row. All120 original bytes are six existing source strings (\" de \",\" le \",\" la \",\"De \",\"Le \",\"La \") each NUL/zero padded to20 bytes, with no original loader fixups. Current static const char*const[6] is a different pointer-array representation. Restore ordinary static const char[6][20], keeping strings, traversal, French rules and lifetime unchanged. This is an evidenced row representation, not a claim of original variable spelling or wider allocation.",
    "Authorize stage1 only: replace seven strcat_s(output,1024,...) statements with plain strcat, three _itoa_s(value,output_num,sizeof(output_num),10) statements with plain _itoa(value,output_num,10), and change the existing local static French array to inline rows. Original calls are _itoa64FC88 at625939/6259AB/625A4A and strcat645470 at625947/625CE6/625D0D (source branches can join calls). Compat wrappers ignore bounds already; no safety or semantic overflow claim. Preserve the original decimal HEX behavior and every existing parser branch/result/invalid-input/uninitialized/error quirk.",
    "83 General function identities are scoped to observe collateral output; the84th subject is the original French table data identity6972D4, NOT another function. Only parse_string body and this private table may change. No other General body/header/signature/global/ABI/compiler flags/framework/library or annotation/claim changes. Preserve all historical TRIED/LEVER findings, original spans and obligations. Add source-owned object binding only after coordinator observes the emitted private row symbol, full120byte physical correspondence, original bounds/evidence and exclusive use; use installed ObjectBinding validation, no guessed symbol or address-to-runtime pointer.",
    "The original reserves FC bytes and uses three separate numeric destination ranges at normalized stack offsets28/78/C8 before pushing each conversion call. After the unchanged Release stage1 control, only if that exact lifetime/frame discrepancy remains may the coordinator score a second candidate declaring three uninitialized80byte scratch arrays at function scope, mapping NUMBER/NUM/HEX to the observed distinct ranges. No fake padding, aggregate invented to force allocation, volatile, asm, copied instructions or flags. Prepare that alternative as ignored WIP only until coordinator asks. At most three evidence-backed source candidates including a possible final French character-comparison order correction (original H precedes other uppercase tests); no extended spelling hunt.",
    "Extend actual-source host tests for numeric/string/grammar/French cases and native pinned witnesses for the three decimal conversions and six20byte rows, with damage controls that distinguish pointer-table substitution, missing calls/rows and relevant behavior. Use safe bounded inputs only and preserve all existing destructive mutants. Updating test-only _itoa/strcat stubs to the actual interfaces is authorized; do not emulate undefined execution as a deterministic requirement. Native physical table reference and old/new private data families require separate coordinator evidence, not a whole-object or whole-TU waiver.",
    "Worker is isolated and host-only. Coordinator owns Git, compiler resources, original Release control of83functions plus data, explicit scope decisions, independent review, fresh build/link and whole known-domain/reference/history/preservation checks before reviewed manual integration and destination rechecks. The prior whole-General frame-flag trials are closed; source/data changes are the new evidence. Preserve useful structural work and report unknowns; raw data/linked residuals may not be relabeled as a pass. Full automatic/linked/runtime/game acceptance remains unfinished."
  ],
